MFLOW 2
NAME Vacuum & push nozzle
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 Water and fluff drop into the left bucket.\nThe suction head drains that bucket through a\none-way pipe; the push-out nozzle shoots the\nmix across into the far bucket.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Turn the suction head down: the left bucket\noverflows.\nTurn the nozzle up: it shoots further.\nRemove the one-way pipe and watch the flow.

